        "created_at": "2019-06-19T21:20:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Rules Question.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>When resolving fear card effects - If they generate more fear and another Fearcard is added as a result of fearcard effect´s</p>\n<p>Do you just contuinue to resolve that / these new fearcard´s before ravegae happens - Or do you wait and resove them in the next invader pahse ?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
